    <!-- Screensaver album. One album, chosen from a list in Settings → General, played as a
         slideshow once nobody has touched the remote for a while. The list holds every album
         the account can see, its own and the ones shared with it, because a television
         choosing what to play in a room is not asking who owns the album. -->
    <string name="settings_screen_saver">Screensaver album</string>
    <string name="settings_screen_saver_hint">Plays this album full screen, on a loop, when nothing is touched for a while. Any key returns to what was on screen.</string>
